---
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
  <title>Wallison Campanelli — Senior Data Engineer & ML Engineer</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Senior Data Engineer & ML Engineer. Azure, Databricks, Snowflake, PySpark, MLOps, Power BI. PhD in Physics (CERN/LIP). Open to remote B2B contracts." />
  <style>
    :root {
      --bg: #0b0e11;
      --bg-card: #12161b;
      --border: #22282f;
      --text: #e7e9ea;
      --text-dim: #9aa4ad;
      --accent: #2dd4bf;
      --accent-dim: #1a4a44;
    }
    * { box-sizing: border-box; }
    body {
      margin: 0;
      background: var(--bg);
      color: var(--text);
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }
    .container { max-width: 880px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 64px 24px 96px; }
    .eyebrow {
      color: var(--accent);
      font-weight: 600;
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.02em;
    }
    h1 { font-size: 2.6rem; margin: 8px 0 4px; font-weight: 800; }
    .subtitle { color: var(--text-dim); font-size: 1.05rem; margin-bottom: 24px; }
    .links { display: flex; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap; margin-bottom: 40px; }
    .links a {
      color: var(--text);
      text-decoration: none;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      padding: 8px 18px;
      border-radius: 8px;
      font-size: 0.92rem;
      transition: border-color 0.15s;
    }
    .links a:hover { border-color: var(--accent); color: var(--accent); }
    hr { border: none; border-top: 1px solid var(--border); margin: 40px 0; }
    h2 { font-size: 1.6rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 18px; }
    p { color: var(--text-dim); }
    .lead { color: var(--text-dim); font-size: 1.02rem; max-width: 700px; }

    .tracks { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 16px; margin-top: 8px; }
    @media (max-width: 700px) { .tracks { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
    .track {
      background: var(--bg-card);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 12px;
      padding: 20px 22px;
    }
    .track .tag {
      display: inline-block;
      color: var(--accent);
      background: var(--accent-dim);
      font-size: 0.72rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 0.04em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      padding: 3px 9px;
      border-radius: 5px;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }
    .track h3 { font-size: 1.12rem; margin: 0 0 8px; font-weight: 700; }
    .track p { font-size: 0.92rem; margin: 0 0 10px; color: var(--text-dim); }
    .track .stack {
      font-size: 0.82rem;
      color: var(--text-dim);
      border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
      padding-top: 10px;
      margin-top: 10px;
    }
    .track .stack b { color: var(--text); font-weight: 600; }

    .exp-item { margin-bottom: 22px; }
    .exp-item .role { font-weight: 700; font-size: 1.02rem; }
    .exp-item .meta { color: var(--text-dim); font-size: 0.88rem; margin-bottom: 6px; }
    .exp-item p { font-size: 0.94rem; margin: 0; }

    .contact-box {
      background: var(--bg-card);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 12px;
      padding: 28px;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .contact-box p { margin-bottom: 18px; }
    .cta {
      display: inline-block;
      background: var(--accent);
      color: #06201c;
      font-weight: 700;
      padding: 10px 24px;
      border-radius: 8px;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-size: 0.95rem;
    }
    footer { text-align: center; color: var(--text-dim); font-size: 0.82rem; margin-top: 56px; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">

    <div class="eyebrow">Senior Data Engineer &amp; ML Engineer</div>
    <h1>Wallison Campanelli</h1>
    <p class="subtitle">Lisbon, Portugal — Open to remote / B2B contracts across Europe &amp; Latin America timezones</p>

    <div class="links">
      <a href="https://github.com/wallisonlac" target="_blank">GitHub</a>
      <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/wallison-campanelli-eng/" target="_blank">LinkedIn</a>
      <a href="mailto:wallisoncampanelli.eng@gmail.com">Email</a>
    </div>

    <hr />

    <h2>About</h2>
    <p class="lead">
      Senior Data Engineer with 8+ years of combined experience building production data pipelines,
      cloud data platforms and ML-enabled systems for energy, oil &amp; gas, public-sector and industrial clients.
      PhD candidate in Physics (University of Lisbon / LIP, in collaboration with CERN), applying
      statistical modelling and neural networks to high-volume detector and sensor data since 2018.
      Comfortable owning a project end-to-end — from raw data to a model or dashboard a stakeholder actually uses.
    </p>

    <hr />

    <h2>What I can pick up</h2>
    <p class="lead" style="margin-bottom: 24px;">
      I work across six overlapping tracks. Most roles I take sit at the intersection of two or more of these.
    </p>

    <div class="tracks">

      <div class="track">
        <span class="tag">Core</span>
        <h3>Data Engineering &amp; Cloud Platforms</h3>
        <p>Production ETL/ELT pipelines, dimensional modelling, streaming and orchestration across enterprise cloud stacks, with pipeline configs as code.</p>
        <div class="stack"><b>Stack:</b> Azure Data Factory, Databricks (Unity Catalog), Synapse Analytics, Microsoft Fabric, Snowflake, PySpark, Kafka, Airflow, Cosmos DB, YAML-based pipeline/CI-CD configs</div>
      </div>

      <div class="track">
        <span class="tag">Growing</span>
        <h3>Machine Learning &amp; MLOps</h3>
        <p>ML models embedded directly in data pipelines: forecasting, anomaly detection, classification on messy real-world time-series.</p>
        <div class="stack"><b>Stack:</b> Python, scikit-learn, PyTorch/TensorFlow, MLflow, Azure ML, time-series &amp; forecasting</div>
      </div>

      <div class="track">
        <span class="tag">Core</span>
        <h3>BI &amp; Business Automation</h3>
        <p>Executive-facing dashboards and semantic models, plus low-code automation that connects directly into the data layer.</p>
        <div class="stack"><b>Stack:</b> Power BI, DAX, Power Query (M language), Power Apps, Power Automate, Azure Functions (event-driven automation wired into Power Automate)</div>
      </div>

      <div class="track">
        <span class="tag">Depth</span>
        <h3>Scientific Computing &amp; Research</h3>
        <p>Statistical modelling and neural networks on high-frequency detector/sensor data for particle-physics experiments (DUNE, SBND, ProtoDUNE 2).</p>
        <div class="stack"><b>Stack:</b> Python, C++, GEANT4, ROOT, neural networks since 2018</div>
      </div>

      <div class="track">
        <span class="tag">Niche</span>
        <h3>Geospatial / GIS</h3>
        <p>Terrain modelling, spatial risk layers and geodatabase work from a Mining Engineering background — transferable to utility &amp; risk-mapping use cases.</p>
        <div class="stack"><b>Stack:</b> ArcGIS, geodatabases, spatial analysis</div>
      </div>

      <div class="track">
        <span class="tag">Delivery</span>
        <h3>Public-Sector &amp; Regulated Delivery</h3>
        <p>Data models and applied ML for national public entities — healthcare, justice and budgetary systems — under real compliance constraints.</p>
        <div class="stack"><b>Clients:</b> SNS (national health system), Ministry of Justice, hospitals, budgetary authority</div>
      </div>

    </div>

    <hr />

    <h2>Recent Experience</h2>

    <div class="exp-item">
      <div class="role">Senior Data Engineer — CGI, Lisbon</div>
      <div class="meta">2025 — Present</div>
      <p>EDP (electric utility), SBM &amp; Oryx (oil &amp; gas), Castle Waters. Automated a 2-week manual BI process into an end-to-end pipeline; converted legacy SQL databases into PySpark pipelines; built executive dashboards.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="exp-item">
      <div class="role">Data Engineer &amp; Instrumentation Specialist — CERN, Geneva</div>
      <div class="meta">Jan 2024 — Dec 2024</div>
      <p>Automated processing workflows for scientific instrumentation data; reduced calibration downtime through anomaly-detection and process automation.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="exp-item">
      <div class="role">PhD Candidate — LIP / University of Lisbon &amp; CERN</div>
      <div class="meta">2022 — Present</div>
      <p>ML and statistical modelling on high-volume detector/laser-sensor time-series for neutrino experiments (DUNE, SBND, ProtoDUNE 2).</p>
    </div>

    <div class="exp-item">
      <div class="role">Data Analyst / BI Developer — 3M Brasil (Remote)</div>
      <div class="meta">2021 — 2022</div>
      <p>Integrated Snowflake with Azure; built global production &amp; demand-planning dashboards; automated week-long reporting down to minutes.</p>
    </div>

    <hr />

    <h2>Let&#39;s talk</h2>
    <div class="contact-box">
      <p>Open to remote and B2B contract roles — data engineering, ML engineering, or a mix of both.</p>
      <a class="cta" href="mailto:wallisoncampanelli.eng@gmail.com">Get in touch</a>
    </div>

    <footer>&copy; 2026 Wallison Campanelli. Built with Astro, deployed on GitHub Pages.</footer>

  </div>
</body>
</html>
